Ghidra x86-64 ELF relocation handler Rust port

This component adapts X86_64_ElfRelocationHandler, X86_64_ElfRelocationType,
X86_64_ElfRelocationContext, AbstractElfRelocationHandler, ElfRelocationHandler,
ElfRelocationContext, ElfGotRelocationContext, ElfSymbolNameUtils and the
relocation loop of ElfProgramBuilder from Ghidra commit
48bf91c252e1389e6becfa5674998177b0193151 of this repository. The original Ghidra
sources and the prior Rust components remain unchanged. This is not an official
release.

